EX-WIFE - GOT CHILD SUPPORT,
TUITION'S DUE NEXT WEEK

332
00:28:58,027 --> 00:28:59,779
Oh, come on.

333
00:29:02,991 --> 00:29:05,452
Who says I haven't got a sad story too?

334
00:29:14,878 --> 00:29:15,753
Chief, hello.

335
00:29:15,754 --> 00:29:17,755
<i>Did you meet with that Professor Jang?</i>

336
00:29:17,756 --> 00:29:20,925
<i>Emiri, right? The Imjin War?</i>

337
00:29:22,635 --> 00:29:24,928
Come on, move! Wake up, let's shake a leg!

338
00:29:24,929 --> 00:29:26,055
Yes, sir!

339
00:29:27,098 --> 00:29:28,140
