340
00:29:28,141 --> 00:29:30,601
This guy uploaded the <i>Veritable Records
of the Joseon Dynasty.</i>

341
00:29:30,602 --> 00:29:31,643
Come on. Get in.

342
00:29:31,644 --> 00:29:33,771
- What does that mean?
<i>- You stupid or something?</i>

343
00:29:33,772 --> 00:29:36,523
<i>This guy keeps posting online about Emiri!</i>

344
00:29:36,524 --> 00:29:39,694
He's practically waving a flag that says,
"Hey, I did it!"

345
00:29:40,195 --> 00:29:41,695
Not only that, get this.

346
00:29:41,696 --> 00:29:43,447
One of his posts has that phrase,

347
00:29:43,448 --> 00:29:47,367
"One fear gives birth to endless fears,
but its methods shall remain hidden."

348
00:29:47,368 --> 00:29:48,494
This is our guy!

349
00:29:48,495 --> 00:29:51,914
<i>"Mutual benefit," remember?
I'll happily take the credit for this one.</i>

350
00:29:51,915 --> 00:29:55,335
<i>Oh, no. Is the poor baby upset?
Don't forget your gun.</i>

351
00:29:56,085 --> 00:29:58,296
'Cause I'm gonna fire a bullet
into your ass.

352
00:30:00,006 --> 00:30:01,132
We're going to Yangpyeong!

353
00:30:31,871 --> 00:30:33,790
Let's go! Come on!

354
00:30:34,290 --> 00:30:35,541
Yes, sir!

355
00:30:35,542 --> 00:30:38,085
- Team 1, break the door!
- Yes, sir!

356
00:30:38,086 --> 00:30:40,003
- Team 2, barricade the front!
- Yes, sir!

357
00:30:40,004 --> 00:30:42,090
- Move!
- Let's go! All units, now!

358
00:30:42,841 --> 00:30:44,717
- Team 3, over here!
- Yes, sir!

359
00:30:45,468 --> 00:30:47,970
What the hell? Is this a prison?

360
00:30:47,971 --> 00:30:49,597
Hurry! Let's go! Inside!

361
00:30:50,181 --> 00:30:53,183
Hey, keep it down!
They'll hear you. In-beom...

362
00:30:53,184 --> 00:30:54,101
- This way.
- Yes, sir.

363
00:30:54,102 --> 00:30:55,270
Inspector K--

364
00:30:56,020 --> 00:30:57,397
Damn arrogant asshole.

365
00:31:53,161 --> 00:31:55,288
<i>No sign of suspect.</i>

366
00:31:56,122 --> 00:31:57,832
<i>Confirm. Suspect not found.</i>

367
00:31:59,125 --> 00:32:01,252
<i>Confirm. Suspect not found.</i>

368
00:32:03,546 --> 00:32:06,089
<i>This the right place, Chief?
There's no one here.</i>

369
00:32:06,090 --> 00:32:07,591
I think we're fucked, sir.

370
00:32:07,592 --> 00:32:10,094
Fuck. Okay, outside.
I swear, I'm gonna lose it.

371
00:32:13,306 --> 00:32:14,515
Come here, come here.

372
00:32:15,308 --> 00:32:16,601
- What?
- Inose.

373
00:32:18,645 --> 00:32:21,314
So IP tracking
usually only gives a rogue estimate.

374
00:32:22,857 --> 00:32:24,441
Look at that antenna.

375
00:32:24,442 --> 00:32:26,736
Ah, good ol' Internet.

376
00:32:28,279 --> 00:32:29,154
Yeah.

377
00:32:29,155 --> 00:32:31,115
- Right, let's go. Yeah.
- Mmm.

378
00:32:32,992 --> 00:32:34,285
Careful, watch your step.

379
00:32:44,671 --> 00:32:47,464
<i>I think it's safe to say
this team has the best 11 players</i>

380
00:32:47,465 --> 00:32:48,674
<i>Korea has ever seen.</i>

381
00:32:48,675 --> 00:32:49,883
<i>Just world-class.</i>

382
00:32:49,884 --> 00:32:52,469
<i>After the change in management
following the last World Cup,</i>

383
00:32:52,470 --> 00:32:56,307
<i>all eyes are on Korea to see if
they can take home the trophy this time.</i>

384
00:32:57,058 --> 00:32:59,393
<i>Marking the first World Cup
of the 21st century,</i>

385
00:32:59,394 --> 00:33:01,436
<i>Korea will have to make it
through the group stages</i>

386
00:33:01,437 --> 00:33:04,273
<i>against Poland,
the United States, and Portugal.</i>

387
00:33:11,489 --> 00:33:13,699
<i>Some have called
for the use of video replay,</i>

388
00:33:13,700 --> 00:33:15,575
<i>a controversial topic, with many claiming</i>

389
00:33:15,576 --> 00:33:18,078
<i>that it will detract
from the authenticity of the game.</i>

390
00:33:18,079 --> 00:33:20,706
<i>Supporters claim
that we should be embracing technology</i>

391
00:33:20,707 --> 00:33:22,499
<i>to improve game specificity.</i>

392
00:33:22,500 --> 00:33:25,502
<i>Needless to say, many worry
about potential loss of momentum</i>

393
00:33:25,503 --> 00:33:28,547
<i>if a referee were to stop a game
to check video monitors.</i>

394
00:33:28,548 --> 00:33:31,758
<i>However, it would leave less room
for errors and misinterpretation.</i>

395
00:33:31,759 --> 00:33:33,927
<i>No one wants another
"Hand of God" situation.</i>

396
00:33:33,928 --> 00:33:35,596
<i>We can all agree on that...</i>

397
00:33:36,389 --> 00:33:38,682
Looks like he was just here.

398
00:33:38,683 --> 00:33:40,684
<i>Experts give South Korea favorable odds,</i>

399
00:33:40,685 --> 00:33:44,063
<i>but everyone, of course,
is nervous that they will get eliminated.</i>

400
00:34:03,416 --> 00:34:04,459
Okay.

401
00:34:06,044 --> 00:34:07,128
Three.

402
00:34:08,046 --> 00:34:09,172
Two.

403
00:34:10,965 --> 00:34:11,799
One.

404
00:34:14,802 --> 00:34:16,386
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

405
00:34:16,387 --> 00:34:18,513
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

406
00:34:18,514 --> 00:34:20,015
- Hands up!
- We didn't do anything!

407
00:34:20,016 --> 00:34:21,391
Yo, Seok, chill.

408
00:34:21,392 --> 00:34:24,145
Relax. Look at them. They're kids.

409
00:34:26,814 --> 00:34:27,815
A man. There's a man!

410
00:34:39,285 --> 00:34:41,954
Ah, what the hell?

411
00:34:43,748 --> 00:34:45,917
Please! I promise I'll get your money!

412
00:34:48,628 --> 00:34:49,712
Who are you?

413
00:34:52,090 --> 00:34:54,300
- What?
- Mr. Park didn't send you?

414
00:34:55,259 --> 00:34:56,928
What are you talking about?

415
00:34:57,470 --> 00:34:58,930
What? Who are you, then?

416
00:35:01,182 --> 00:35:02,433
Detective Kim.

417
00:35:05,144 --> 00:35:06,562
What does this say?

418
00:35:08,481 --> 00:35:09,648
I found it inside.

419
00:35:09,649 --> 00:35:11,858
MANAGE ONLINE OPINION
COMMENT WRITING SERVICES

420
